.TH SDE-SYSTEM-MONITOR 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-system-monitor \- SDE process and resource monitor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-system-monitor
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect processes, CPU, memory and file systems in SDE System Monitor.
.PP
This is an independent native executable built from the SDE fork sources
and included in the sde package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display the native application options.
